    <bpmn:process id="W_W4250" name="W4250. Daily Shuttle Dispatch, Manifest &amp; Passenger Check-In" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Each scheduled shift, daily
Frequency: Multiple trips/day per route (2–3 shifts)
Volume: ~6,911 employees; majority of store/DC shift staff boarding daily
Owner: Transport Dispatcher / Site Transport Coordinator
Participants: Drivers, Site Managers (VS-07/VS-04), Security (VS-23), HR (VS-103)
Source: workflow W4250 — Daily Shuttle Dispatch, Manifest &amp; Passenger Check-In</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4250_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4250_Lane1" name="Dispatcher">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4250_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4250_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4250_Lane2" name="Driver">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4250_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4250_Lane3" name="Coordinator">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4250_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4250_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4250_Start5" name="Each scheduled shift, daily">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4250_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4250_Task6" name="Dispatcher generates the daily trip manifest (route, driver, vehicle, expected…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Dispatcher generates the daily trip manifest (route, driver, vehicle, expected riders from W4251), confirms vehicle/driver readiness (pre-trip W4252), and dispatches on schedule
Responsible (R): Dispatcher / Driver
Accountable (A): Transport Lead
Duration: Per trip</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4250_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4250_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4250_Task7" name="Driver/Coordinator board employees against the manifest (check-in — employee…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Driver/Coordinator board employees against the manifest (check-in — employee ID/ESS QR), enforce seat-belt/no-overload, and log actual riders/departure/arrival times
Responsible (R): Driver / Coordinator
Accountable (A): Transport Lead
Duration: Per trip</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4250_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4250_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4250_Task8" name="Coordinator closes the trip (actual manifest, no-shows, exceptions), flag…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Coordinator closes the trip (actual manifest, no-shows, exceptions), flag issues (overcapacity, refused boarding), and feed ridership data to analytics (W4264) and payroll/allowance (W4253)
Responsible (R): Coordinator / Dispatcher
Accountable (A): Transport Lead
Duration: Per trip</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4250_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4250_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4250_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4250_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4250_Annotation10">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-654 (ensure controlled execution — Shuttle Service, Route &amp; Daily Commute Operations (PA-141.2).) | - CTL-654: manifest enforced (no unentitled boarding); seat-belt/no-overload; trip closed &amp; reconciled
Owner: Transport Dispatcher / Site Transport Coordinator</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4250_Assoc11" sourceRef="W4250_Annotation10" targetRef="W4250_Start5" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4250_Flow12" sourceRef="W4250_Start5" targetRef="W4250_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4250_Flow13" sourceRef="W4250_Task6" targetRef="W4250_Task7" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4250_Flow14" sourceRef="W4250_Task7" targetRef="W4250_Task8" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4250_Flow15" sourceRef="W4250_Task8" targetRef="W4250_End9" />
    </bpmn:process>
