    <bpmn:process id="W_W4251" name="W4251. Employee Entitlement, Ridership Eligibility &amp; Seat Allocation" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Policy (W4242); hire/transfer (VS-19.1/VS-103); capacity change
Frequency: On eligibility change + periodic rebalance
Volume: Entitlement records for eligible employees × route/shift
Owner: HR Shared Services (VS-103.1) / Transport Lead
Participants: HR (VS-19/VS-103), Site Managers, Employees
Source: workflow W4251 — Employee Entitlement, Ridership Eligibility &amp; Seat Allocation</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4251_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4251_Lane1" name="HR Shared Services">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4251_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4251_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4251_Lane2" name="Transport Lead">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4251_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4251_Lane3" name="HR">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4251_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4251_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4251_Start5" name="Policy (W4242); hire/transfer (VS-19.1/VS-103); capacity change">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4251_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4251_Task6" name="HR/Transport determine each employee&#x27;s transport entitlement from policy (W4242…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: HR/Transport determine each employee&#x27;s transport entitlement from policy (W4242 — shift, role, site, distance), assign to route/seat, and maintain the ridership register in HRIS/ESS
Responsible (R): HR Shared Services / Transport
Accountable (A): Head of HR Shared Services
Duration: Per change</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4251_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4251_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4251_Task7" name="Transport allocate seats against capacity (W4245/W4249), manage waitlists and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Transport allocate seats against capacity (W4245/W4249), manage waitlists and alternates, and update on hire/transfer/exit (VS-19.1/VS-103)
Responsible (R): Transport Lead / HR
Accountable (A): Transport Lead
Duration: Per change</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4251_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4251_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4251_Task8" name="HR/Transport handle entitlement exceptions (temporary eligibility, route-swap…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: HR/Transport handle entitlement exceptions (temporary eligibility, route-swap request), approve per policy, and audit entitlement vs actual ridership (W4264)
Responsible (R): HR / Transport Lead
Accountable (A): Head of HR Shared Services
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4251_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4251_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4251_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4251_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4251_Annotation10">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-654 (ensure controlled execution — Shuttle Service, Route &amp; Daily Commute Operations (PA-141.2).) | - CTL-654: entitlement policy-driven (W4242); synced to HRIS lifecycle (VS-19/VS-103); audited vs ridership
Owner: HR Shared Services (VS-103.1) / Transport Lead</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
