    <bpmn:process id="W_W4256" name="W4256. Transport Helpdesk, Employee Inquiry &amp; Exception Handling" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Employee inquiry/complaint; missed shuttle; route-swap; lost item
Frequency: Daily
Volume: Inquiries across the workforce (ride issues, schedule, allowance)
Owner: HR Shared Services / Transport Helpdesk (VS-103.1)
Participants: Transport Lead, Site Managers, Payroll (VS-19.2), HR (VS-103)
Source: workflow W4256 — Transport Helpdesk, Employee Inquiry &amp; Exception Handling</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4256_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4256_Lane1" name="Transport Helpdesk">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4256_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4256_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4256_Lane2" name="Helpdesk">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4256_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4256_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4256_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4256_Start4" name="Employee inquiry/complaint; missed shuttle; route-swap; lost item">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4256_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4256_Task5" name="Helpdesk receive employee transport inquiries (missed shuttle, route/stop…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Helpdesk receive employee transport inquiries (missed shuttle, route/stop request, lost item, allowance dispute, safety concern) via ESS/call/hotline, log a case, and triage
Responsible (R): Transport Helpdesk / HR Shared Services
Accountable (A): Head of HR Shared Services
Duration: Per case</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4256_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4256_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4256_Task6" name="Helpdesk resolve or route the case (dispatch a backup, arrange alternate…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Helpdesk resolve or route the case (dispatch a backup, arrange alternate transport, escalate safety to HSE W4254/W4255, route payroll to VS-19.2), and track to closure
Responsible (R): Helpdesk / Transport / Payroll
Accountable (A): Transport Lead
Duration: Per case</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4256_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4256_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4256_Task7" name="Helpdesk analyze recurring issues (missed shuttles, complaint themes), feed CI…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Helpdesk analyze recurring issues (missed shuttles, complaint themes), feed CI (W4263/VS-133) and EX (W4248), and report SLA performance
Responsible (R): Helpdesk / Analytics
Accountable (A): Head of HR Shared Services
Duration: Periodic</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4256_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4256_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4256_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4256_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
