        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-654 (ensure controlled execution — Shuttle Service, Route &amp; Daily Commute Operations (PA-141.2).) | - CTL-654: cases logged/tracked to closure; SLA monitored; safety escalations to HSE (VS-24)
Owner: HR Shared Services / Transport Helpdesk (VS-103.1)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
